{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:a4a7cfe1913720b3","name":"Igren Demos","source":{"id":"source:reference-a4a7cfe1913720b3","title":"Igren Demos","revision":21620,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T02:09:29Z","sha256":"9e3d4223e03d9f90e893880b74982fce8da1d01c016e52c0beb1b76f988933f4","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=21620","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Igren%20Demos&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-a4a7cfe1913720b3","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dawn of Defiance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dawn_of_Defiance"}," (",{"tag":"a","children":["A Wretched Hive"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/A_Wretched_Hive","referenceId":"reference:499e9f32005279b4"},")"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Affiliations: ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Hutt Kajidics"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Hutt_Kajidics","referenceId":"reference:3f107406b356c3df"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["This slender ",{"tag":"a","children":["Neimoidian"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Neimoidian","referenceId":"reference:907b5a99c5e02624"}," is dressed in robes of dark greens and blues, with a ceremonial headdress that makes him seem taller than he truly is. The majordomo moves with grace, radiating both elegance and superiority, and his red eyes seem to focus on a distant spot, as though seeing something that no one else sees."]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Igren Demos has been the majordomo of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Darga the Hutt"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Darga_the_Hutt","referenceId":"reference:cf39a7b12acc3031"}," for some years now. Even before Darga came to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cato Neimoidia"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cato_Neimoidia","referenceId":"reference:6720e9092ebc841e"},", Demos served him faithfully and helped build the criminal organization into what it is today. In fact, it was Demos who discovered the ruined palace in Zarra, allowing Darga to seize it for his own. Over the years, Demos has been plotting to overthrow Darga and take control of the organization, but for the time being, the majordomo is content to influence events in ways that even the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hutt"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hutt","referenceId":"reference:38066b70aa2676d9"}," does not suspect.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The secret to Demos' success is his ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Sensitivity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Sensitivity","referenceId":"reference:5202cab02f367bcf"},". Though he has never shared the truth with anyone, ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Jedi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Jedi","referenceId":"reference:d320edb17de6c558"}," identified him as a potential recruit when he was a child, but his ",{"tag":"a","children":["Neimoidian"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Neimoidian","referenceId":"reference:907b5a99c5e02624"}," parents refused to let ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Jedi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Jedi","referenceId":"reference:d320edb17de6c558"}," take him. Growing up, he learned to use ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"}," to exert his will over others, and when he came into Darga's service, he brought the same skills into play to build a criminal empire. Demos is not powerful enough to influence his ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hutt"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hutt","referenceId":"reference:38066b70aa2676d9"}," master, but he continues to use his ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Sensitivity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Sensitivity","referenceId":"reference:5202cab02f367bcf"}," in secret to ensure that events occur according to his desires, not necessarily those of the crime lord.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Igren Demos Statistics (CL 5)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Normal"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Medium ",{"tag":"a","children":["Neimoidian"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Neimoidian","referenceId":"reference:907b5a99c5e02624"}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Noble"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Noble","referenceId":"reference:190d375ec3483f8f"}," 5\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Force Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Points"},":"]}," 4; ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Dark Side Score"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dark_Side_Score"},":"]}," 9\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},":"]}," +3; ",{"tag":"b","children":["Senses:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," +10\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Languages:"]}," Basic, Dosh, Gamorrean, Huttese, Neimoidian\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Defenses"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},": 17 (",{"tag":"a","children":["Flat-Footed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Flat-Footed"},": 16), ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fortitude_Defense"},": 15, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Will Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Will_Defense"},": 20\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Points","referenceId":"reference:58e8ee2c9538d027"},": 32, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Threshold"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Threshold"},": 15\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Offense"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","chil